w:goodreads.v1.MhRKyX3ks_bocxK7hKDSHA","creator":{"__ref":"User:21670009"},"recommendFor":"anyone interested in Lady Joan of Kent \u0026 The Middle Ages.","updatedAt":1599234221692,"createdAt":1419534357000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1448873376000,"text":"Wow! What a life The Fair Maid of Kent, Lady Joan, lived. Quite a dynamic personality. Unfortunately, the Plantagenets kept marrying their first cousins, and as a result, they produced some weak monarchs, but this book discusses the life of Joan of Kent. It was a fascinating one. This book takes place during the 14 Century, and when I think how much was done in the 14 Century while wars were continued to be fought, it truly amazes me. The book started a bit slow for me, but then picked up, and it kept me very interested. The author researched her material well. I felt as though i was right there with Joan and her family. That was grand! A very good look at life in The Middle Ages.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AW462RW5M8VUK\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.fUJLZJZxqJcEmWfcWJSi7g\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:3742075":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":3742075,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1650399265i/3742075._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":7,"textReviewsCount":1485,"name":"Natasa","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3742075-natasa","contributor":null,"id":3742075},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANRG84O8COFDI":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANRG84O8COFDI"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANRG84O8COFDI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.fUJLZJZxqJcEmWfcWJSi7g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANRG84O8COFDI","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANRG8